      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pre-2017\n\nCustom backend\non raw Lucene\n\nmaster indexes,\nsnapshots to S3\n\nslaves poll S3,\nserve reads\n\none of Yelp's\noldest live systems",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
